    <string name="onb_welcome_title">Assalamu’alaykum</string>
    <string name="onb_welcome_body">Welcome. This app is for reading the Qur’an in the Madani mushaf. First, choose the language of the app.</string>
    <string name="onb_mushaf_title">About this mushaf</string>
    <string name="onb_mushaf_body">Pages follow the Madani mushaf printed by the King Fahd Complex: Uthmani script, riwayah Hafs, 604 pages of 15 lines. Other page styles, such as IndoPak or Shamarly, are not included, so if you are used to one of them the letters and page layout will look different.</string>
    <string name="onb_translation_title">Translations</string>
    <string name="onb_translation_body">Translations are downloaded when you add them, so the app stays small. You can also read without a translation.</string>
